<title>UK: Helical reports flat first-half profit.</title>
<headline>Helical reports flat first-half profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.9		    vs 1.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.15		   vs 2.9</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.4		    vs 4.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   45.7		   vs 28.0</p>
<p> Operating result	 9.5		    vs 8.7</p>
<p> Interest payable	 4.9		    vs 4.3</p>
<p> Tax			  1.1		    vs 0.7</p>
<p> Pay date		   Nov 11</p>
<p> Div registration date  Oct 15</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Oct 7</p>
<p>NOTE - Helical Bar Plc is a property investment group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
